From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Lu=C3=ADs=20Duarte?= <lduarte@cloudflare.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 15:27:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] UA stylesheet: overflow:hidden on svg viewport elements

SVG2 render.html#OverflowAndClipProperties: the UA style sheet sets
overflow:hidden on svg elements. Without the rule computed overflow is
the initial visible, so blitz-paint's overflow-honouring replaced-svg
clip (blitz-paint 0006) would never engage; with it, an author
overflow:visible still wins and re-enables painting outside the
viewport. `*|svg` because this sheet's default @namespace is XHTML.
---
 assets/default.css | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/assets/default.css b/assets/default.css
index ef832f8..8326439 100644
--- a/assets/default.css
+++ b/assets/default.css
@@ -1155,3 +1155,12 @@ slot {
         background-color: transparent;
     }
 }
+
+/* SVG2 render.html#OverflowAndClipProperties: the UA sheet
+   establishes overflow:hidden on svg viewport elements. The paint-side
+   replaced-svg clip honours computed overflow, so an author
+   overflow:visible re-enables painting outside the viewport. `*|svg`
+   because this sheet's default @namespace is XHTML. */
+*|svg {
+    overflow: hidden;
+}
